// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : From {SENDER_NAME} 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P573283567" "From {SENDER_NAME}"
// LocationString :
"P3817773604" "Valentine"
// ProfessionString :
"P856364347" ""
// CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P3277183394" "Fusionette"
// CORRECT_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P2452496922" "Awwww! How sweet!<br><br>Jim is such a great guy. I can't wait to finish this investigation, bust those Lost punks who are responsible, grab a shower, and then get ready for dinner tonight. He's taking me out but won't tell me where. I have a feeling that tonight is going to be full of surprises...<br><br>Oh my god, you don't think he's going to propose to me tonight, do you?!"
// WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P510700898" "Lady Grey"
// WRONG_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P259767750" "You have got to be kidding me, right?<br><br>Isn't Jim Temblor dating that Annette girl, Fusionette?<br><br>See, this is why dating should be forbidden in the workplace... I'm over three times that boy's age...<br><br><color orange>Lady Grey looks at you with a brief moment of scrutiny.</color><br><br>And no, that wasn't to mean that I was considering it even an option... He never mentions my name in here, I'll just assume it is for Annette and make sure this gets to her; proactively disarming a situation before it can start."
// VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT :
"P2633968865" "You find a nice store bought card, the cover of which has a series of fancy swirls in silver forming heart shapes with a drawing of a pristine wooded valley covered in melting snow as the sun rises over a distant mountain range. A nice romantic message involving sunrises and the seasons of winter and spring help to seal the imagery. Inside the card reads:"
// VALENTINE_TEXT :
"P3114440268" "<i>May our love bloom eternal<br>When I first saw you I knew that we were meant to be. You are such a special and unique person, it is hard to think of a world without you in it. People look up to you, you draw the eye of everyone when you enter a room, people love you, and I love you as well.<br>Jim</i><br><br><color yellow>Adorable, Jim Temblor, aka, Faultline, is sending this Valentine to his sweetheart, Fusionette. After reading over the sappy card once more you realize that Jim never mentions Fusionette by name. It could be amusing to give this to someone it is definitely not intended for... like Lady Grey for example.</color>"
// SENDER_NAME :
"P3230763425" "Faultline"
// VALENTINE_CLUE :
"P2747600360" "This Valentine is adorned with cheerful updates of pagan fertility symbols."
// CORRECT_DELIVERY_LOCATION :
"P2650611411" "A Vanguard Supply Warehouse"
// CORRECT_DELIVERY_INACTIVE :
"P1073437971" "Alright, I think we've got all the clues we need to track those Lost down."
// AskAboutTextOverride :
"P3668577043" "Reconsider your options"
// ContactRequiresText :
"P3611273721" "You are of the wrong alignment to get this tip."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2659787689" "You're unsure of exactly what to do with this information"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1255120992" "This Valentine is of no use to you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1338064068" "You already have enough things to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3623388284" "You're currently too busy to act upon this information."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3299591369" "Failsafe"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ValentineIntro Text :
"P1991995872" "<font face=title><scale 1.1><span align=center><color pink>To {CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME} from {SENDER_NAME}...</color></span></scale></font><br><span align=center><color pink><i>Valentine</i></color></span><br><br>{VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT}<br><br><scale 1.1><font face=computer><color BurlyWood>{VALENTINE_TEXT}</scale></font></color><br><br>This Valentine could be delivered to {CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME}... or if you wanted to be a little troublemaker, you could deliver it to {WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME} instead."
// Answer Text :
"P2244335353" "Deliver the Valentine to {CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME}"
// Answer Text :
"P858485596" "Deliver the Valentine to {WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME}"
// Page Fallback Text :
"P4115829606" "This Valentine is apparently illegible."
// Answer Text :
"P2965007035" "Deal with it later"
